# api_wait_deferred.scn — other commands arriving while `takeoff` waits are NOT dropped or reordered
#                         `takeoff` の待機中に届いた他のコマンドは捨てず、順序も変えない
#
# Only `emergency` and `stop` are acted on during a wait. Everything else must behave exactly as
# before the fix: it waits and runs, in arrival order, after the blocking command has answered.
# Here a `height?` and a second `takeoff` arrive while the first `takeoff` waits: `height?` must
# be answered after FLYING, and the second `takeoff` must then be refused ("not on ground"),
# i.e. it must not start a second takeoff chain in the middle of the first.
# 待機中に動くのは `emergency` と `stop` だけ。他はmain（2026-11-08 時点）と全く同じ振る舞い — 待機中のコマンドが
# 応答した後に、到着順で実行される。ここでは最初の `takeoff` の待機中に `height?` と二つ目の
# `takeoff` が届く: `height?` は FLYING の後に応答し、二つ目の `takeoff` は "not on ground" で
# 拒否される（最初の離陸の途中で 二つ目の離陸の鎖を始めない）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/api_wait_deferred.scn --target vehicle --duration 20000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                          # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # C: takeoff (t=6)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50      # D: climb (to t=6.5)
   +    api        "height?"                                          # E: arrives during the wait
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     300       50      # F: (to t=6.8)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # G: second takeoff, arrives during the wait
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     10000     50      # H: the first takeoff finishes, then the queued lines run (to t=16.8)
